ROUTE RECONCILIATION (no silent drift — covenant #9): the web router (web/src/App.tsx) maps
`/battery` AND `/battery/health` to BatteryHealthPage, and `/energy` to EnergyPage. The predecessor
EnergyPage work had INCORRECTLY aliased `/battery` + `/battery/health` -> `.energy` in
AppRouteParser (its own log notes `.energy` carried those aliases). This prompt adds the canonical
`.batteryHealth` AppRoute case (pathSegment `battery`, group `.energy`) and corrects those two
aliases to `.batteryHealth`, so `/battery` now renders BatteryHealthPage at web parity. EnergyPage
remains at `/energy` untouched. Navigation registration is in this prompt's allowed-files scope.

